{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Interactions.confinementUniversality","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Interactions.confinementUniversality","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic"],"declarations":13,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.inherited_unit_invisible_of_confinement","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.inherited_unit_invisible_of_confinement","kind":"theorem","line":72,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/confinementUniversality.lean#L72-L84","doc":"**Corollary (a one-line consequence of the class field `h_N_F`).** If a\nquantity `U` of the photon (for instance the chirality unit `u` read off the photon\npolarisation, bean `qou-qs2u`) can be read off the nucleon NF by some `g`, then `U` is\nconstant. So under the conjecture a photon-inherited chirality unit is hidden at\nnucleon level; it does not contradict the conjecture. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.ofFlavourInput","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.ofFlavourInput","kind":"theorem","line":65,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/confinementUniversality.lean#L65-L70","doc":"**True by construction.** A context whose nucleon NF is a fixed value `G`, the NF\nof the confinement word for a fixed flavour assignment, satisfies the class. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.confinementUniversality","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.confinementUniversality","kind":"theorem","line":52,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/confinementUniversality.lean#L52-L63","doc":"**Proposition statement** (from manuscript, definitional reading): with the quark\nflavours `f` supplied as input, the nucleon NF of the chain\n`γγ → q q̄ → B₃ · crossings` does not depend on the photon coefficients\n`(φ₀, φ₁, φ₀₁)`, because the confinement word contains none of them. It depends only on\n`q` and `f`. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:prop:confinement-universality","label":"prop:confinement-universality","md":"quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/confinement-universality.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.ConfinementUniversalityConjecture.h_N_F","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.ConfinementUniversalityConjecture.h_N_F","kind":"theorem","line":50,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/confinementUniversality.lean#L50-L50","doc":"General polarization case equals reference. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.ConfinementUniversalityConjecture.h_N_F_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.ConfinementUniversalityConjecture.h_N_F_zero","kind":"theorem","line":48,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/confinementUniversality.lean#L48-L48","doc":"Zero-polarization case equals reference. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.ConfinementUniversalityConjecture.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.ConfinementUniversalityConjecture.mk","kind":"ctor","line":45,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/confinementUniversality.lean#L45-L45","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.ConfinementUniversalityConjecture","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.ConfinementUniversalityConjecture","kind":"class","line":44,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/confinementUniversality.lean#L44-L50","doc":"The physical hypotheses carried by the Confinement Universality Conjecture. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.ConfinementUniversalityContext.N_F_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.ConfinementUniversalityContext.N_F_zero","kind":"def","line":42,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/confinementUniversality.lean#L42-L42","doc":"Reference zero-polarization nucleon NF value. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.ConfinementUniversalityContext.N_F","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.ConfinementUniversalityContext.N_F","kind":"def","line":40,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/confinementUniversality.lean#L40-L40","doc":"Nucleon NF as a function of photon polarisation coefficients\n`(φ_0, φ_1, φ_01)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.ConfinementUniversalityContext.N","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.ConfinementUniversalityContext.N","kind":"def","line":37,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/confinementUniversality.lean#L37-L37","doc":"Neutron number `N`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.ConfinementUniversalityContext.Z","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.ConfinementUniversalityContext.Z","kind":"def","line":35,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/confinementUniversality.lean#L35-L35","doc":"Proton number `Z`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.ConfinementUniversalityContext.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.ConfinementUniversalityContext.mk","kind":"ctor","line":33,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/confinementUniversality.lean#L33-L33","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.ConfinementUniversalityContext","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.ConfinementUniversalityContext","kind":"class","line":31,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/confinementUniversality.lean#L31-L42","doc":"Abstract context for the `confinementUniversality` claim — manuscript-named\ntyped fields below. ","signatureChunk":0}]}